<h3>Taken up by</h3>
<ul class="links">
<li class="t-word y-adapts"><span class="thread">The Word</span> <a href="#k-ben">Ben of Somewhere</a> <b>adapts</b> <a href="#k-ana">Ana</a> <span class="ref">(<cite>Ben 1.1</cite>)</span></li>
<li class="t-law y-rejects"><span class="thread">The law</span> <a href="#k-dee">Dee</a> <b>rejects</b> <a href="#k-ana">Ana</a> <span class="ref">(<cite>Dee 3</cite>)</span></li>
</ul>
