<h2 id="k-ben-name">Ben of Somewhere</h2>
<p class="dates">20 BC – AD 50</p>
<p>Spans both lanes.</p>
<h3>Drew on</h3>
<ul class="links">
<li class="t-word y-adapts" id="L1">
<p class="claim"><span class="thread">The Word</span> <a href="#k-ben">Ben of Somewhere</a> <b>adapts</b> <a href="#k-ana">Ana</a></p>
<blockquote><p>In the beginning.</p></blockquote>
<p class="ref"><cite>Ben 1.1</cite>, <a href="https://example.com/ben">A Translation (1900)</a>, via Example</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3>Taken up by</h3>
<ul class="links">
<li class="t-word y-quotes"><span class="thread">The Word</span> <a href="#k-cal">Cal</a> <b>quotes</b> <a href="#k-ben">Ben of Somewhere</a> <span class="ref">(<cite>Cal 2</cite>)</span></li>
</ul>
